# Maintenance UI Polish — Restricted Skills

During **Mode C** (`CHECKPOINT.next_mode = C`), UI work is limited to these skills:

| Skill | Path |
|-------|------|
| ui-ux-pro-max | `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md` |
| 21st-cache | `.cursor/skills/21st-cache/SKILL.md` |
| 21st-cli-use | `.agents/skills/21st-cli-use/SKILL.md` |
| 21st-ai | `.agents/skills/21st-ai/SKILL.md` |

## Forbidden during Mode C

Do **not** use: `high-end-visual-design`, `frontend-design`, `bolder`, `colorize`, or hand-rolled components without 21st search first.

## Workflow

1. ui-ux-pro-max design-system search for target screen
2. 21st-cache → `21st search` → install/adapt
3. Brainstorm: best design? over-engineered? pros/cons
4. `npm run build` + live visual check at 390px
5. Update `docs/window-instances/ux-relay/STATE.md` HISTORY
